+## Contract
 
+`TipJar` takes the token address at construction (Base USDC in the deploy script) and refuses to
+deploy against an address with no code, which is what stops a jar from being deployed on a bare
+`yarn chain`.
 
-## Documentation
+| Function                          | Who        | Notes                                                     |
+| --------------------------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `tip(amount, message)`            | anyone     | Pulls `amount` via `transferFrom`; message max 140 bytes  |
+| `getLatestTips(offset, limit)`    | view       | Newest-first page of the feed, plus the feed length       |
+| `tipCount()` / `totalTipped()`    | view       | Feed length; lifetime total, not reduced by withdrawals   |
+| `totalTippedBy(address)`          | view       | Lifetime total per sender                                 |
+| `balance()`                       | view       | USDC currently held                                       |
+| `withdraw(to)`                    | owner only | Sends the whole balance to `to`                           |
 
