+# Block explorer — disabled
+
+Scaffold-ETH's local block explorer is excluded from routing (Next.js skips folders whose name
+starts with `_`).
+
+It cannot be part of this project's build: `output: "export"` has no server to resolve the dynamic
+`address/[address]` and `transaction/[txHash]` routes, and the pages touch `localStorage` at import
+time, which crashes static prerendering. It is also pointless in production, where the app targets
+Base and links out to Basescan.
+
+To use it locally, rename this folder back to `blockexplorer` and run `yarn start`. Rename it back
+before any IPFS build.
